Design a 4-bit binary multiplier that computes the product of two 4-bit inputs, `a` and `b`. The module generates an 8-bit output, `out`, representing the multiplication result. The functionality includes bitwise AND operations between each bit of `a` and the entire vector `b`, followed by a summation of the appropriate weighted contributions of the resultant partial products.
